{"version":1,"content":"<p>伊朗國營傳媒周一引述伊朗總統佩澤希齊揚表示，最高領袖穆傑塔巴已向政府批出有關美伊和平談判的「特定權力」。</p><p>佩澤希齊揚強調德黑蘭「會嘗試透過對話解決問題」，但未進一步闡述。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T00:21:10.192833+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":85,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T00:18:18.012042+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T00:18:09.718896+00:00","content_hash":"fca5b99c7c1c6293e4aa48f7cbcbd0d21a4da5b4d3118d48129f539e05e816cb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}